  card: `Every dragon in the Seven Kingdoms is on this map: twenty of them, each circling where it is kept. Six belong to the queen's party, the greens: five over King's Landing and Tessarion, far off in Oldtown with Prince Daeron. Eight belong to the party of the king's daughter Rhaenyra, the blacks, on Dragonstone and Driftmark. Six have no rider: three whose riders are long dead and three wild dragons that nest in the Dragonmont. In 129 AC King Viserys I dies in the Red Keep, and his council keeps it quiet for seven days. The realm has one king and one heir. It is about to have two of each.`,
