  card: `Daemon answers a son with a son. Through Mysaria he hires two men known to history only as Blood and Cheese. They reach the Red Keep by its hidden passages, make Queen Helaena choose between her sons, and kill the heir, Jaehaerys, in front of her. Blood is caught at the Gate of the Gods; Cheese is never found. Helaena withdraws to her rooms and Dreamfyre stays chained in the Dragonpit. Aegon turns to drink and rage, dismisses his grandfather Otto as Hand for fighting the war with letters, and gives the office to Criston Cole. No dragon flies in this step.`,
