  card: `Criston Cole marches out of King's Landing with the men of Rosby and Stokeworth, sacks Duskendale and lays siege to Rook's Rest, whose lord sends a raven to Dragonstone. Nine days later Princess Rhaenys arrives on Meleys, the Red Queen. It is a trap. Aegon on Sunfyre and Aemond on Vhagar come at her together, a thousand feet up; Meleys gets her jaws on Sunfyre's neck and Vhagar falls on both. All three go down and only Vhagar rises. Rhaenys and Meleys are dead, Sunfyre lies at Rook's Rest with a wing half torn away, and Aegon is carried home too badly burned to rule. Aemond takes the style Protector of the Realm.`,
