  caps: [[0.04, "Ormund Hightower's army comes up from the Reach with Prince Daeron, knighted after the Honeywine."], [0.2, "At Bitterbridge a mob of Rhaenyra's supporters finds Prince Maelor, three years old, and kills him."], [0.26, 'Daeron burns the town.'], [0.32, 'Rhaenyra sends Hugh Hammer and Ulf the White to hold Tumbleton.'], [0.6, 'At Tumbleton the two change sides.'], [0.65, 'Vermithor, Silverwing and Tessarion burn the town they were sent to defend.'], [0.72, 'Roderick Dustin kills Ormund Hightower and dies of his wounds.'], [0.82, "In King's Landing Addam is suspected too, and escapes on Seasmoke."], [0.87, 'Corlys, who warned him, goes to the cells.']],
  card: `Prince Maelor, three years old and on the run with one knight, is found by a mob of Rhaenyra's supporters at Bitterbridge and killed; Daeron burns the town in revenge. Ormund Hightower's army, with Daeron and Tessarion, closes on Tumbleton, and Rhaenyra sends Hugh Hammer and Ulf the White to hold it. At Tumbleton the two dragonseeds change sides: Vermithor and Silverwing burn the town they were sent to defend, alongside Tessarion. Roderick Dustin kills Ormund and dies of his own wounds. In King's Landing the betrayal poisons trust in every dragonseed. Rhaenyra orders Addam and Nettles seized; Addam escapes on Seasmoke, and Corlys, who warned him, goes to the cells.`,
  reading: 'Defection: two hires cross over and take their assets with them.',
