  caps: [[0.1, 'Sunfyre, missing for half a year, reaches Dragonstone. No one saw how.'], [0.32, 'He kills the wild Grey Ghost on the Dragonmont. The castle blames the Cannibal.'], [0.4, 'Larys has smuggled Aegon to the island. Rider and dragon find each other.'], [0.48, 'Alfred Broome, passed over for castellan, turns the garrison.'], [0.52, 'Baela takes Moondancer up against Sunfyre.'], [0.64, 'Moondancer is blinded and killed in the crash. Baela is taken; Aegon breaks both legs.'], [0.72, "Rhaenyra's Grand Maester, Gerardys, is killed."]],
  card: `Sunfyre, missing for half a year, turns up on Dragonstone, where fishermen find the burned remains of the wild Grey Ghost; the castle blames the Cannibal. Larys Strong has smuggled Aegon II to the island in disguise, and rider and dragon find each other and fly again. Ser Alfred Broome, passed over for castellan, turns the garrison against the queen. Baela takes Moondancer up against Sunfyre: the young dragon is quicker but far smaller, and is blinded and killed when they crash. Baela is taken. Aegon breaks both legs jumping clear and has Rhaenyra's Grand Maester, Gerardys, killed. Sunfyre will not fly again. The blacks have lost their home.`,
