  vig: 'dragonpit',
  caps: [[0.07, "The Velaryon fleet deserts over Corlys's arrest."], [0.18, "Queen Helaena dies on the spikes below Maegor's Holdfast. The city believes she was murdered."], [0.23, 'In the Dragonpit Dreamfyre snaps two of her chains.'], [0.3, 'Riots. A preacher called the Shepherd leads a mob up the Hill of Rhaenys to kill the dragons.'], [0.44, "Joffrey takes his mother's Syrax to go to them. She throws him, and he falls to his death."], [0.55, 'In the pit Shrykos, Morghul and Tyraxes are killed.'], [0.66, 'Dreamfyre brings the dome down on her killers.'], [0.7, 'Syrax dies falling on the survivors.'], [0.8, 'Rhaenyra leaves by the Dragon Gate for Duskendale.']],
  card: `The Velaryon fleet deserts over Corlys's arrest. Queen Helaena dies on the spikes below Maegor's Holdfast, and the city believes she was murdered; in the Dragonpit Dreamfyre snaps two of her chains. Riots follow. A preacher called the Shepherd leads a mob up the Hill of Rhaenys to kill the dragons. Joffrey takes his mother's Syrax to go to them; she throws him and he falls to his death. In the pit Shrykos, Morghul, Tyraxes and Dreamfyre are killed, Dreamfyre bringing the dome down on her attackers, and Syrax dies falling on the survivors. Five dragons in a night, killed by the city they were kept to defend. Rhaenyra leaves by the Dragon Gate.`,
